  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Educational Reforms in Ukraine programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with the Ministry of Education and Science of Ukraine in support of sustainable and systematic democratic reforms in education, decemtralisation of school governance and modernisation of curricula. Implement SCR1325 through rights-based governance. Gender issues reflected in training.</narrative>
  </description>
